  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in the tagine over medium heat.",
    "Add the grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for another minute.",
    "Add the diced bitter melon and cook until it starts to soften.",
    "Add the fish fillets and cook for 2 minutes on each side.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the soy sauce and honey.",
    "Pour the soy sauce mixture over the fish and bitter melon.",
    "Cover the tagine and cook for 10 minutes.",
    "Drizzle the sesame oil over the top and serve.",
    "Garnish with green onions and serve over rice or noodles."
